#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Indicates if the LRA coordinator managed by Quarkus Dev Services is shared. When shared, Quarkus looks for running containers using label-based service discovery. If a matching container is found, it is used, and so a second one is not started. Otherwise, Dev Services for LRA coordinator starts a new container."
msgstr "Indica si el coordinador de LRA gestionado por Quarkus Dev Services es compartido. Cuando se trata de un coordinador compartido, Quarkus busca contenedores en ejecución mediante el descubrimiento de servicios basado en etiquetas. Si se encuentra un contenedor que coincida, se utiliza dicho contenedor y, por lo tanto, no se inicia un segundo. De lo contrario, Dev Services para el coordinador de LRA inicia un nuevo contenedor."

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The discovery uses the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label. The value is configured using the `service-name` property."
msgstr "El descubrimiento utiliza la etiqueta `«quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` ». El valor se configura mediante la propiedad `«service-name` »."

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Container sharing is only used in dev mode."
msgstr "El uso compartido de contenedores solo se utiliza en modo de desarrollo."

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_LRA_DEVSERVICES_SHARED+++[]"
msgstr "Variable de entorno: env_var_with_copy_button:QUARKUS_LRA_DEVSERVICES_SHARED[]"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-narayana-lra_quarkus-lra-devservices_quarkus-lra-devservices-service-name]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-narayana-lra_quarkus-lra-devservices_quarkus-lra-devservices-service-name[`+++quarkus.lra.devservices.service-name+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.lra.devservices.service-name+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for LRA coordinator looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label set to the specified value.\n"
"\n"
"This property is used when you need multiple shared LRA coordinators.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_LRA_DEVSERVICES_SERVICE_NAME+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "[lock]  link:#quarkus-narayana-lra_quarkus-lra-devservices_quarkus-lra-devservices-service-name[quarkus.lra.devservices.service-name] config_property_copy_button:quarkus.lra.devservices.service-name[]"

